[h1]Medkits Assorted[/h1]
New medkits, bags, a backpack and a first responder tactical vest: portable containers that accept [b]medical items only[/b].

I created this mod first and foremost with Neurotrauma in mind. I always found it difficult to organise my inventory while playing with NT, and I especially wanted small, handy medkits to distribute among crew members (the IFAK).


[quote][b]AI use disclaimer:[/b]
The item sprites and talent icons were generated with AI, some with minor manual edits.
The infographics and the mod's cover are rendered by a script written by an AI coding agent.
The mod's code was written with the help of an AI coding agent, and I reviewed all of it myself (I'm a software developer by profession).
Design, testing and balancing were done by me.[/quote]

[quote][b]Author's note:[/b] I know AI is controversial, and I'm not a fan of AI "art" myself. I only decided to publish the mod because the final result doesn't have that "AI slop" feel, especially at Barotrauma's item scale (with the possible exception of the First Responder Vest, whose front still looks like slop). That being said, as a programmer I can vouch for AI code: coding agents have improved significantly over the past [i]few[/i] years, and in many cases they write higher-quality code than many programmers do.[/quote]

